{"unit_id":"tan000tan__dsh-solidworks#feature-1","repo":"tan000tan/dsh-solidworks","commit":"911ccb13e6cdf487871601b1b8d9b60bdf4a83bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-solidworks 的功能「检查模型」：查询 SolidWorks 模型的质量属性、边界框和几何信息。通过 DSH 注册的只读 CAD 工具触发，结果返回当前模型的测量与检查数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/policy.js:20-40"]}
{"unit_id":"tan000tan__dsh-solidworks#feature-2","repo":"tan000tan/dsh-solidworks","commit":"911ccb13e6cdf487871601b1b8d9b60bdf4a83bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-solidworks 的功能「策略控制的 CAD 操作」：将 MCP 服务提供的 SolidWorks 工具按策略档位发布。默认只读；标准档允许受限建模，完整档可开放保存、导出等持久化调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/policy.js:20-80","cordis.patch.yml:9-19"]}
{"unit_id":"tan000tan__dsh-solidworks#feature-3","repo":"tan000tan/dsh-solidworks","commit":"911ccb13e6cdf487871601b1b8d9b60bdf4a83bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-solidworks 的功能「诊断运行环境」：检查 Python 解释器和 MCP 服务启动状态，并提供状态工具返回环境信息与最近错误，方便定位 CAD 工具不可用的原因。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:122-129","lib/discover.js:105-146"]}
